{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"同伦群(稳定同伦论)"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"同伦群 (稳定同伦论)"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦论","text":"稳定同伦论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦论","text":"稳定同伦论"}},{"Plain":"中, 由于每个对象都是任意阶的环路空间, 对象的 “"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦群","text":"同伦群"}},{"Plain":"” 都是 $\\mathbb E_\\infty$-代数 ("},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换群"}},{"Plain":"); 对整个"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定 $\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":"而言, 各阶同伦群的地位相同, 仅相差平移.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>通过 t-结构</h3>\n<p>设"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定 $\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 带有 "},{"Local":{"url":"t-结构","text":"t-结构"}},{"Plain":" $(\\mathcal C_{\\geq 0},\\mathcal C_{\\leq 0})$, 其心为 $\\mathcal C^\\heartsuit = \\mathcal C_{\\geq 0}\\cap\\mathcal C_{\\leq 0}$. 定义函子\n$\\pi_0\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\tau_{\\geq 0}\\tau_{\\leq 0} = \\tau_{\\leq 0}\\tau_{\\geq 0}$. 对整数 $n$ 定义 $\\pi_n (X) = \\pi_0 (X[-n])$.</p>\n<h3>通过余极限</h3>\n<p>对于来自"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定化","text":"稳定化"}},{"Plain":"过程的"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定 $\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":", 例如"},{"Local":{"url":"谱","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Sp","text":"$\\mathsf{Sp}$"}},{"Plain":", 其中对象的同伦群可定义为逼近它的一列对象的同伦群的"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":": 若\n$$\r\nX = \\operatorname{colim}_k \\Sigma^{\\infty-k} X_k,\r\n$$\n则\n$$\r\n\\pi_n(X) = \\operatorname{colim}_k \\pi_{n+k} X_k.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}